From: hectorqin <14220132+hectorqin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 10:00:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(sidebar): nest git worktree projects under their
 repository

Worktree directories (CloudCLI's own <repo>-worktrees/<name> and any linked
worktree) are registered as separate projects, so every agent or feature
worktree adds a top-level sidebar row. Projects now carry worktreeOf (the
main repository path, resolved from the worktree's .git file, or from the
<repo>-worktrees layout once the directory is removed), and the sidebar
renders those projects indented under their repository. No session moves
between projects, so nothing is hidden or lost.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
